%% showcase: zenuml dividers
%% prose: `==text==` draws a labelled divider across every lifeline: a double rule from the first participant to the last, with the text on a pill in the middle. The label is the line with its `=` fences trimmed, so `== Later ==` reads the same.
%% approx: The divider is a double rule with a pill, mmd's sequence look rather than ZenUML's.
zenuml
    Alice->Bob: Hello
    Bob->Carol: Pass it on
    ==Later that day==
    Carol->Alice: Bye
